{"key":"map/gz11d1","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/smith","title":"Babur the Tightfist","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/karh","title":"Bor the Cunning","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/loozer","title":"Brigand","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone11dun1%20lizardblue","title":"Lake lizard (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone11dun1%20lizardmonstr","title":"Tomb guardian","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/fq13","title":"Hall of the Great","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q16ag","title":"The Magic Needle","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz11g","title":"Distant Mountains","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Lizardmen's tomb</h1><p>The lizardmen turned this abandoned underground palace of an ancient civilization into a tomb for their chieftains. No human has entered it for centuries.</p><h2>The Free Hunters and Babur</h2><p>A <a href=\"wiki://character/loozer\">messenger</a> invites the rescuers of the hunters to <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>’s camp. Bor claims neutrality in the war, yet asks them to act against the village’s hunters and caravans. To question <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a> about the Orb, Kir helps bring him out of the village. The letter can go to Babur himself or to the elder, with different explanations for the craftsman’s arrival. Babur then sends Kir to the lizards’ tomb for a supposed magical needle. The expedition supplies lizard hides, and Babur admits that useful armour material was his real interest. For information about the Orb, he redirects the visitors to Estera. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/loozer\">Brigand</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_120)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_121)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_123)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_124)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_126a)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/karh\">Bor the Cunning</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_126b)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a> (briefing brief_127)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/smith\">Babur the Tightfist</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_128)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/gipat\">Gipath</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz11g\">Distant Mountains</